CHAPTER.VERS:
And he said to them, Truly I say to you

          {+}
        , There are some here of those who stand, who will in no way taste of death, until they see the kingdom of God come with power.

And there came a cloud overshadowing them: and there came a voice out of the cloud, This is my beloved Son: hear

          {+}
         him.

But I say to you

          {+}
        , that Elijah has come, and they have also done to him whatever they would, even as it is written of him.

And he asked them, What do you

          {+}
         question with them?

And he answers them and says, O faithless generation, how long shall I be with you

          {+}
        ? How long shall I bear with you

          {+}
        ? Bring him to me.

And they came to Capernaum: and when he was in the house he asked them, What were you

          {+}
         reasoning on the way?

For whoever will give you

          {+}
         a cup of water to drink, because you

          {+}
         are Christ's, truly I say to you

          {+}
        , he will in no way lose his reward.

Salt is good: but if the salt has lost its saltness, how will you

          {+}
         season it? Have salt in yourselves, and be at peace one with another.
